{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Daily Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) নিচের কোনটি সঠিক যখন, a<sup>m</sup>/a<sup>n</sup>=a<sup>1/(n-m)</sup>?", "option1": "ক) m&ge;n", "option2": "খ) m&gt;n", "option3": "গ) n&gt;m", "option4": "ঘ) n&ge;m", "answer": "0", "exp": "<sup>1/n</sup><p>a<sup>m</sup>/a<sup>n</sup>=a<sup>1/(n-m</sup>) হবে যখন n&gt;m হবে।</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>-4</sup>-0.0001=0 হলে, x<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 100", "option2": "খ) 10", "option3": "গ) 1/10", "option4": "ঘ) 1/100", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>-4</sup>-0.0001=0<br />&rArr;1/x<sup>4</sup>=1/10,000<br />&rArr;x=10<br />&rArr;x<sup>2</sup>=100<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) (4<sup>x+2</sup>-16&times;4<sup>x-2</sup>)/4<sup>x-1</sup>=?", "option1": "ক) 50", "option2": "খ) 60", "option3": "গ) 39", "option4": "ঘ) 40", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(4<sup>x+2</sup>-16&times;4<sup>x-2</sup>)/4<sup>x-1<br /></sup>=(4<sup>x</sup>&times;4<sup>2</sup>-4<sup>2</sup>&times;4<sup>x</sup>&times;4<sup>-2</sup>)/4<sup>x</sup>&times;4<sup>-1</sup><br />=4<sup>x</sup>(4<sup>2</sup>-1)/4<sup>x</sup>&times;4<sup>-1</sup><br />=15&times;4<br />=60</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;..........a=(a<sup>1/n</sup>)<sup>n</sup>। a এর n তম মূল কত?", "option1": "ক) a", "option2": "খ) n", "option3": "গ) a<sup>1/n</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 1/a", "answer": "0", "exp": "প্রশ্নে টাইপের ভুল আছে। তাই, উত্তর বাতিল করা হয়েছে।p>a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;a<sup>1/n</sup>&times;..........a<sup>1/n</sup> = (a<sup>1/n</sup>)<sup>n</sup><br />=a<sup>(1/n+1/n+1/n.......1/n</sup>)<br />=a<sup>n&times;1/n</sup><br />=a<br /> a এর n তম মূল হল a<sup>1/n</sup>।(RFE 9-10 text book.)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) <p>log<sub>10</sub>[98+&radic;(x<sup>2</sup>-12x+36)]=2 হলে এর x মান কত?&nbsp;</p>", "option1": "ক) 6,8", "option2": "খ) 8,4", "option3": "গ) 10,7", "option4": "ঘ) 4,6", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>10</sub>[98+&radic;(x<sup>2</sup>-12x+36)]=2<br />&rArr;10<sup>2</sup>-98=&radic;(x<sup>2</sup>-12x+36)<br />&rArr;2<sup>2</sup>=(&radic;(x<sup>2</sup>-12x+36))<sup>2</sup><br />&rArr;x<sup>2</sup>-12x+32=0<br />&rArr;(x-8)(x-4)=0<br />&rArr;x=4,8</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>0</sup>+y<sup>1</sup>+z<sup>0</sup>=কত?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) y+2", "option4": "ঘ) y", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>0</sup>+y<sup>1</sup>+z<sup>0</sup>=1+y+1=y+2</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) x,y,z&gt;0;হলে&nbsp;&radic;(x<sup>-2</sup>y<sup>2</sup>)&times;&radic;(y<sup>-2</sup>z<sup>2</sup>)&times;&radic;(z<sup>-2</sup>x<sup>2</sup>) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) xyz", "option4": "ঘ) y", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>&radic;(x<sup>-2</sup>y<sup>2</sup>)&times;&radic;(y<sup>-2</sup>z<sup>2</sup>)&times;&radic;(z<sup>-2</sup>x<sup>2</sup>)<br />=&radic;(y<sup>2</sup>/x<sup>2</sup>)&times;&radic;(z<sup>2</sup>/y<sup>2</sup>)&times;&radic;(x<sup>2</sup>/z<sup>2</sup>)<br />=y/x&times;z/y&times;x/z<br />=1</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) যদি x,y বাস্তব সংখ্যা এবং x&ne;0,y&ne;0 হয়, তবে (x<sup>x</sup>)<sup>0</sup>+(y<sup>y</sup>)<sup>0</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) x+y", "option3": "গ) xy", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(x<sup>x</sup>)<sup>0</sup>+(y<sup>y</sup>)<sup>0</sup>&nbsp;<br />=1+1<br />=2<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) log36/log6=?", "option1": "ক) 5", "option2": "খ) 8", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 9", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>log6<sup>2</sup>/log6<br />=2log6/log6<br />=2<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) 9&times;2<sup>n</sup>-2&times;2<sup>n-1</sup>=কত?", "option1": "ক) 2<sup>n+3</sup>", "option2": "খ) 2<sup>n-3</sup>", "option3": "গ) 2<sup>n</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>9&times;2<sup>n</sup>-2&times;2<sup>n-1</sup><br />=9&times;2<sup>n</sup>-2&times;2<sup>n</sup>/2<br />=2<sup>n</sup>(9-1)<br />=2<sup>n</sup>.2<sup>3</sup><br />=2<sup>n+3</sup></p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) 400 এর 4; ভিত্তি কত?", "option1": "ক) 2&radic;7", "option2": "খ) 2&radic;5", "option3": "গ) 3&radic;8", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>a</sub>400=4<br />&rArr;a<sup>4</sup>=20<sup>2</sup><br />&rArr;a<sup>4</sup>=(4&times;5)<sup>2</sup><br />&rArr;a<sup>4</sup>=2<sup>4</sup>&times;(&radic;5)<sup>4</sup><br />&rArr;a=2&radic;5</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) 3log<sub>10</sub>2+log<sub>10</sub>5=কত?", "option1": "ক) log<sub>10</sub>40", "option2": "খ) log<sub>10</sub>67", "option3": "গ) log<sub>10</sub>45", "option4": "ঘ) log<sub>10</sub>30", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>3log<sub>10</sub>2+log<sub>10</sub>5<br />=log<sub>10</sub>8+log<sub>10</sub>5<br />=log<sub>10</sub>40<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) log<sub>&radic;8</sub>x=10/3 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 52", "option2": "খ) 32", "option3": "গ) 44", "option4": "ঘ) 23", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>&radic;8</sub>x=10/3<br />&rArr;(&radic;8)<sup>10/3</sup>=x<br />&rArr;(2<sup>3/2</sup>)<sup>10/3</sup>=x<br />&rArr;x=2<sup>5</sup>=32</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) (81)<sup>2x+3</sup>=9<sup>3x-6</sup> হয় তবে x=কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 12", "option3": "গ) -1", "option4": "ঘ) -12", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(81)<sup>2x+3</sup>=9<sup>3x-6</sup><br />&rArr;(9)<sup>4x+6</sup>=9<sup>3x-6</sup><br />&rArr;4x+6=3x-6<br />&hArr;x=-12</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) 8<sup>2/3</sup>+81<sup>1/4</sup>=7k হয় তবে k এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 7/2", "option4": "ঘ) 4/3", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>8<sup>2/3</sup> + 81<sup>1/4</sup> = 7k<br />&rArr; 2<sup>6/3</sup> + 3<sup>4/4</sup> = 7k<br />&rArr; 4+3 = 7k<br />&rArr; k = 1</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) নিচের কোন শর্তে a<sup>x</sup>=b<sup>y</sup> হলে a=b হবে?", "option1": "ক) a>0,b<0,x=0", "option2": "খ) a<0,b<0,x=0", "option3": "গ) a&gt;0,b&gt;0,x&ne;0", "option4": "ঘ) a&lt;0,b&gt;0,x&ne;0", "answer": "0", "exp": "প্রশ্নে টাইপের ভুল আছে। তাই, উত্তর বাতিল করা হয়েছে।<p>a&gt;0,b&gt;0,x&ne;0 শর্তে a<sup>x</sup>=b<sup>x</sup> হলে a=b হবে</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) P=x<sup>a</sup>,Q=x<sup>b</sup> হলে P<sup>bc</sup>&times;Q<sup>-ca</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) x", "option4": "ঘ) -1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>P<sup>bc</sup>&times;Q<sup>-ca</sup> <br />=(x<sup>a</sup>)<sup>bc</sup>&times;(x<sup>b</sup>)<sup>-ca</sup><br />=x<sup>abc-abc</sup><br />=x<sup>0</sup>=1</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) 2<sup>n</sup>+1 নিচের কোনটির সমান?", "option1": "ক) x+2", "option2": "খ) 4<sup>n</sup>-1", "option3": "গ) (4<sup>n</sup>-1)/(2<sup>n</sup>-1)", "option4": "ঘ) (4<sup>n</sup>-1)/(2<sup>n</sup>)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>2<sup>n</sup>+1<br />={(2<sup>n</sup>+1)(2<sup>n</sup>-1)}/(2<sup>n</sup>-1)<br />=(4<sup>n</sup>-1)/(2<sup>n</sup>-1)</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) যদি a<sup>x</sup>=b, b<sup>y</sup>=c, c<sup>z</sup>=a হয় তাহলে xyz= কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>এখন,c<sup>z</sup>=a<br />&rArr;(b<sup>y</sup>)<sup>z</sup>=a<br />&rArr;(a<sup>x</sup>)<sup>yz</sup>=a<br />&rArr;a<sup>xyz</sup>=a<sup>1</sup><br />&rArr;xyz=1</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) [8-10(8-10)<sup>-1</sup>]<sup>-1</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 13", "option2": "খ) -13", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 1/13", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>[8-10(8-10)<sup>-1</sup>]<sup>-1</sup> এর মান&nbsp;<br />=[8-10(-2)<sup>-1</sup>]<sup>-1</sup><br />=[8+10/2]<sup>-1</sup><br />=[13]<sup>-1</sup><br />=1/13</p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) log<sub>2</sub>&radic;6-log<sub>2</sub>&radic;(3/2) এর মান কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 1/2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>2</sub>&radic;6-log<sub>2</sub>&radic;(3/2)<br />=log<sub>2</sub>(&radic;2&times;&radic;3&times;&radic;2/&radic;3)<br />=log<sub>2</sub>2<br />=1</p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) যদি y=3 হয় তাহলে&nbsp;&radic;y<sup>3</sup> এর 3 ভিত্তিক লগ কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 2/3", "option2": "খ) 3/2", "option3": "গ) 4/3", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>&radic;y<sup>3</sup>= &radic;3<sup>3</sup>=27<sup>1/2</sup><br />=log<sub>3</sub>27<sup>1/2</sup><br />=log<sub>3</sub>3<sup>3/2</sup><br />=(3/2)log<sub>3</sub>3<br />=3/2</p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) log<sub>x</sub>(2/3)=-1/2 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4/9", "option2": "খ) 1/4", "option3": "গ) 9/4", "option4": "ঘ) 1/9", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>log<sub>x</sub>(2/3)=-1/2<br />&rArr; x<sup>-1/2</sup>=2/3<br />&rArr;x<sup>1/2</sup>=3/2<br />&rArr;(x<sup>1/2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>=(3/2)<sup>2</sup><br />&rArr;x=9/4</p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) log<sub>5</sub>(<sup>3</sup>&radic;5)(&radic;5)=কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 6/5", "option3": "গ) 1/5", "option4": "ঘ) 5/6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>log<sub>5</sub>(<sup>3</sup>&radic;5)(&radic;5)<br />=log<sub>5</sub>5<sup>(1/3+1/2)</sup><br />=log<sub>5</sub>5<sup>(5/6)</sup><br />=5/6log<sub>5</sub>5<br />=5/6</p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) (10x)<sup>0</sup>+10x<sup>0</sup> এর মান নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) 10", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 11", "option4": "ঘ) 20", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>(10x)<sup>0</sup>+10x<sup>0</sup>&nbsp;<br />=1+10&times;1<br />=11</p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) (0.24&times;10<sup>p</sup>)/(0.3&times;10<sup>q</sup>)=8&times;10<sup>7</sup> হলে q-p= কত?", "option1": "ক) 8", "option2": "খ) -8", "option3": "গ) 5", "option4": "ঘ) 12", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(0.24&times;10<sup>p</sup>)/(0.3&times;10<sup>q</sup>)=8&times;10<sup>7</sup>&nbsp;<br />&rArr;0.8&times;10<sup>p-q</sup>=8&times;10<sup>7</sup><br />&rArr;10<sup>p-q</sup>=10<sup>8</sup><br />&rArr;p-q=8<br />&rArr;q-p=-8</p>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) log<sub>10</sub>&radic;2